config BM_MEMFAULT_LOCK
	bool "NCS BM Memfault platform lock (irq_lock-based)"
	default y
	depends on NCS_BM && MEMFAULT && !MULTITHREADING
	help
	  Use an irq_lock()-based implementation of memfault_lock()/memfault_unlock()
	  for bare-metal builds without Zephyr multithreading.

	  Memfault calls may originate from both the main loop and ISRs. This option
	  replaces the default Zephyr k_mutex-based lock with a critical-section lock.

	  See doc/nrf-bm/libraries/memfault.rst for rules on which Memfault APIs
	  may be called from each execution context.
